  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1440844/description_e3d71af0-a95c-4b2d-bdc0-8d90c59eb07e.png\">強化 PvP 視覺效果，同時保持方塊/物品紋理為原版</strong></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>為制霸戰場而生。</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1440844/description_d290d1fb-8650-4942-82ea-1e92eafcfd72.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>關於：</strong></p>\n<p>Onyx PvP Essentials 專為追求更乾淨、更專注戰鬥體驗的玩家而設計。它移除了視覺雜訊並降低干擾性特效，讓你能在戰鬥中更輕易地追蹤對手並更快做出反應。</p>\n<p>搭配深色介面、精細化的粒子效果與優化後的視覺呈現，整體操作更流暢易讀。每一項改動都細膩卻具實質幫助。</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1440844/description_2a16eca2-e779-4c0b-9e9f-c38650b9eba6.gif\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>特色：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>降低火焰高度</li>\n<li>降低盾牌高度</li>\n<li><em>深色模式自訂介面</em></li>\n<li>白色附魔閃光</li>\n<li>縮小工具尺寸以提升視野</li>\n<li>重新製圖的效果/暴擊/命中粒子</li>\n<li>移除不必要的粒子效果（如爆炸、食物等）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>還不夠嗎？試試看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fascentmc.gumroad.com%252fl%252fonyxultra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ONYX Ultra</a>！*五折優惠*</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>YT - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ascent_mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@ascent_mc</a></p>\n<p>TikTok - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540ascent.mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tiktok.com/@ascent.mc</a></p>\n<p>商店 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fascentmc.gumroad.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ascentmc.gumroad.com/</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
